<title>USA: Fiberchem sees Q2 net loss.</title>
<headline>Fiberchem sees Q2 net loss.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>FiberChem Inc said Thursday it expects to post a loss for its second quarter, ended March 31, of $890,000, including a $250,000 charge for the write-off of accrued interest on notes receivable.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement it expects to report sales of about $620,000 compared with revenues of $566,162 and a loss of $538,174 in the comparable year-ago quarter.</p>
</text>
